 {:seon.fix/created-ms 1795414222418,
  :seon.fix/symptom "Exceeding the 268 MB eval allocation cap mid-d/transact permanently self-deadlocked the child REPL worker in mdb_txn_begin -> mdb_flock_wait (mdb.c:572) -> _pthread_mutex_firstfit_lock_slow while holding runs/store/lock.mdb fcntl writer lock, blocking every sibling worker until kill -9.",
